WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.317
Sequence analysis needs two things before lag or the next-value function can make sense.

00:00:06.317 --> 00:00:11.502
First, define whose sequence you are analyzing with partition by.

00:00:11.502 --> 00:00:14.592
Second, define the event order.

00:00:14.592 --> 00:00:20.727
Then choose lag for a previous value or the next-value function for a next value.

00:00:20.727 --> 00:00:25.481
If the order is ambiguous, the sequence result is ambiguous too.
